WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 075. SAME GOAL. DIFFERENT MACHINE. Regulatory designs create different work.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
OPEN. GOVERNANCE. INSTITUTIONS. LICENSING. Trace authority and entry.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
FOLLOW. ENFORCEMENT. RIGHTS. DATA. FINANCING. Each choice changes burdens and safeguards.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
SWAP. CHANGE ONE DIMENSION. Hold seven fixed; inspect the tradeoff.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
BOUNDARY. DESIGN ≠ CURRENT LAW. Synthetic models only.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
SAVE. COMPARE TRADEOFFS. Keep claims small and connections visible.
